    "hook": [
     "A queen mother tells her son what a king’s mouth is for."
    ],
    "consider": [
     "Whom does Lemuel’s mother tell him to speak for? What is the difference between ending a life and allowing it to end?"
    ],
    "reflect": [
     "Who near you has no voice where decisions about them are made? What could you say, or ask, on their behalf this month?"
    ]
